# Runtime data: live SQLite database, WAL sidecars and backups.
# Never track these — the repo must not carry a database at the same path as production.
# Leading slash anchors this to the repo root: an unanchored "data/" would also
# match src/data/, which holds bundled runtime assets that MUST stay tracked.
/data/
